    "icon_boxes_MVUhkE": {
      "type": "icon-boxes",
      "blocks": {
        "icon_box_eiAFmG": {
          "type": "_icon-box",
          "name": "t:names.icon_box",
          "settings": {
            "text_align": "center",
            "icon": "waves",
            "icon_image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Lumeia_Normalized_Icon_Graphics_06_High_Protein.png",
            "icon_size": "custom-size",
            "icon_width": 76,
            "icon_width_mobile": 56,
            "link": "",
            "heading": "Whey Protein Concentrate",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>A complete protein with all nine essential amino acids your body needs to build and maintain itself. The amino acid profile in whey is the closest match to what your body actually uses. Protein contributes to a growth in muscle mass and to the maintenance of normal bones.*</p>",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-6",
            "border_radius": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "icon_box_wP3yJr": {
          "type": "_icon-box",
          "name": "t:names.icon_box",
          "settings": {
            "text_align": "center",
            "icon": "tag",
            "icon_image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Lumeia_Normalized_Icon_Graphics_03_Collagen_Power.png",
            "icon_size": "custom-size",
            "icon_width": 76,
            "icon_width_mobile": 56,
            "link": "",
            "heading": "OmniCol™ 120 Hydrolysed Bovine Collagen Peptides",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>Collagen is the structural protein behind your skin's firmness, your hair's strength, and your nails' resilience. After 25, your body produces less of it every year. 1,500mg of hydrolysed collagen peptides in every sachet, layered into your protein so one sachet supports both your body and your skin.</p>",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-6",
            "border_radius": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "icon_box_qhiRpw": {
          "type": "_icon-box",
          "name": "t:names.icon_box",
          "settings": {
            "text_align": "center",
            "icon": "tag",
            "icon_image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Lumeia_Normalized_Icon_Graphics_05_Digestive_Enzymes_8892f5a1-948b-4ab2-b641-5beda948c755.png",
            "icon_size": "custom-size",
            "icon_width": 76,
            "icon_width_mobile": 56,
            "link": "",
            "heading": "Bromelain Enzyme",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>A natural enzyme from pineapple that breaks protein into smaller pieces your body can use. Paired with 22g+ of whey protein and 1,500mg of collagen in the same sachet. That pairing is deliberate.</p>",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-6",
            "border_radius": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "icon_box_7exjWT": {
          "type": "_icon-box",
          "name": "t:names.icon_box",
          "settings": {
            "text_align": "center",
            "icon": "tag",
            "icon_image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Lumeia_Normalized_Icon_Graphics_24_Digestive_Enzymes.png",
            "icon_size": "custom-size",
            "icon_width": 76,
            "icon_width_mobile": 56,
            "link": "",
            "heading": "Lactase Enzyme",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>Lactose is the number one cause of bloating with protein powders. Lactase breaks it down before it reaches your gut, so the protein sits comfortably from the first sachet. The comfort this formula provides is a design decision, not a side effect.</p>",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-6",
            "border_radius": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "icon_box_LHLgKd": {
          "type": "_icon-box",
          "name": "t:names.icon_box",
          "settings": {
            "text_align": "center",
            "icon": "tag",
            "icon_image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Lumeia_Normalized_Icon_Graphics_04_Botanical_Blend.png",
            "icon_size": "custom-size",
            "icon_width": 76,
            "icon_width_mobile": 56,
            "link": "",
            "heading": "Moringa Leaf Powder",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>One of the most nutrient-dense leaves in nutritional science. Rich in plant compounds studied for their protective properties. Eaten as a daily green across South Asia and East Africa for generations.</p>",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-6",
            "border_radius": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "icon_box_kNQXWe": {
          "type": "_icon-box",
          "name": "t:names.icon_box",
          "settings": {
            "text_align": "center",
            "icon": "tag",
            "icon_image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Lumeia_Normalized_Icon_Graphics_08_Skin_Elasticity.png",
            "icon_size": "custom-size",
            "icon_width": 76,
            "icon_width_mobile": 56,
            "link": "",
            "heading": "Gotu Kola Herb Extract",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>The same plant family that powers the entire CICA skincare movement, included here alongside your collagen. Traditionally valued in Ayurvedic and East Asian wellness for centuries. Two skin-associated ingredients working together in one sachet.</p>",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-6",
            "border_radius": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "icon_box_8R3HrX": {
          "type": "_icon-box",
          "name": "t:names.icon_box",
          "settings": {
            "text_align": "center",
            "icon": "tag",
            "icon_image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Lumeia_Normalized_Icon_Graphics_01_Gut_Friendly.png",
            "icon_size": "custom-size",
            "icon_width": 76,
            "icon_width_mobile": 56,
            "link": "",
            "heading": "Dandelion Root Extract",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>A traditional bitter herb with natural prebiotic fibre. Valued across European and Middle Eastern herbal traditions as part of daily wellness. Part of the reason this formula covers more ground than any standard protein.</p>",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-6",
            "border_radius": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
