          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Complete protein. Perfect quality score.¹¹ Your body can use virtually all of it.<br/><br/>Whey is what remains when milk is gently separated and concentrated. It delivers all nine essential amino acids in the ratios your body uses to build, maintain, and recover. The leucine content in whey is the highest of any food protein source, and leucine is the amino acid that signals your body to start building.⁴<br/><br/>Plus 1,500mg of OmniCol™ 120 hydrolysed bovine collagen peptides in every sachet, broken down to under 2,500 Dalton for absorption.¹ Two proteins working together: one for your body, one for your skin.<em><br/><br/>OmniCol™ is a trademark of Essentia Protein Solutions (BHJ A/S), Denmark.</em></p>",
