          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_6KHcKh": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "text": "What is Thrive Protein and who is it for?",
                "open_row_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_size": "custom-size",
                "width": 32,
                "width_mobile": 24
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_wzPLEx": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Thrive Protein is a daily protein sachet with 22-23g of whey protein, 1,500mg of hydrolysed collagen peptides (OmniCol™ 120), digestive enzymes, and a botanical complex. It is designed for women in Kuwait and the GCC who want daily protein without the gym-bro experience. You do not need to be a gym-goer. You might be a busy professional, a mother, a woman who walks and does pilates, or someone who simply wants more protein for energy, skin, and general wellness.</p>",
                    "highlight_style": "none",
                    "highlight_font_style": "italic",
                    "highlight_shape_color": "",
                    "highlight_text_color": "",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_weight": "",
