            "accordion_row_V3GCXz": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "text": "What makes Thrive different from other protein powders?",
                "open_row_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_size": "custom-size",
                "width": 32,
                "width_mobile": 24
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_rYBVFJ": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Most protein powders give you protein and stop there. You end up adding a collagen here, an enzyme there, a greens powder on the side. Suddenly it is four products, four price tags, and four routines. Thrive puts 22g+ of whey protein, 1,500mg of collagen peptides, digestive enzymes, and a botanical complex into one sachet. It comes in single-serve sachets in three café-inspired flavours that genuinely taste good. It is Halal certified, EU-made, and independently tested at Eurofins laboratories. <strong>One sachet covers more ground than any standard protein. That is the difference.</strong></p>",
                    "highlight_style": "none",
                    "highlight_font_style": "italic",
                    "highlight_shape_color": "",
                    "highlight_text_color": "",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
