            "accordion_row_h4QKTH": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "text": "Will it cause bloating or breakouts?",
                "open_row_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_size": "extra-large",
                "width": 24,
                "width_mobile": 24
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_mz3XtV": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Most protein bloat comes from cheap whey blends, fillers, and lactose-heavy formulas. Thrive uses premium whey protein concentrate and includes lactase enzyme to break down the lactose naturally present in the whey base. The formula was designed for sensitive stomachs from day one. If protein powders have caused you discomfort before, it was the product, not you. If your body still disagrees, the 60-day money-back promise is yours.</p>",
                    "highlight_style": "none",
                    "highlight_font_style": "italic",
                    "highlight_shape_color": "",
                    "highlight_text_color": "",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
