            "accordion_row_hxNEUg": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "text": "How much collagen is in it, and is that a clinical dose?",
                "open_row_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_size": "custom-size",
                "width": 32,
                "width_mobile": 24
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_FHXjtG": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>1,500mg of OmniCol™ 120 hydrolysed collagen per sachet. We are honest about this. Clinical-strength collagen studies for visible skin outcomes typically use higher doses, 2,500mg or more9, which is why our <a href=\"/products/complete-collagen\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Complete Collagen\">Complete Collagen ritual</a> carries 10,500mg. The 1,500mg in Thrive is a daily complementary dose. If collagen is your primary goal, layer both products. If protein is your priority, Thrive gives your skin a daily dose alongside your protein.</p>",
                    "highlight_style": "none",
                    "highlight_font_style": "italic",
                    "highlight_shape_color": "",
                    "highlight_text_color": "",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
