              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_LYCPri": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "text": "Are there additives in this formula?",
                "open_row_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_size": "custom-size",
                "width": 32,
                "width_mobile": 24
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_mxpRAn": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes, and we will be honest about them. The formula is 84-86% whey protein concentrate. The remainder is premium European collagen peptides, enzymes, plant extracts, and a small number of functional additives: sunflower lecithin for clean blending, carrageenan and xanthan gum for texture, sucralose and stevia for sweetness without added sugar, Himalayan salt, and calcium phosphates for anti-caking. The Cappuccino variant also includes instant coffee and a caramel colour. <strong>A protein only works if you actually drink it every day, and we designed Thrive to be something you look forward to, not something you force down.</strong></p>",
                    "highlight_style": "none",
                    "highlight_font_style": "italic",
                    "highlight_shape_color": "",
                    "highlight_text_color": "",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_weight": "",
