            "accordion_row_LCrHV3": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "text": "What does it taste like?",
                "open_row_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_size": "custom-size",
                "width": 32,
                "width_mobile": 24
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_gNbW4W": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Three café-inspired flavours. Chocolate Hazelnut is rich and smooth and reminds you of something you probably spread on toast as a child! Tahitian Vanilla is subtle, not too sweet, and works beautifully in recipes. Cappuccino is creamy, lightly sweet, and genuinely tastes like a quality coffee drink. None of them are chalky, none of them taste artificial, and none require you to hold your nose. These flavours are part of why women stay consistent.</p>",
                    "highlight_style": "none",
                    "highlight_font_style": "italic",
                    "highlight_shape_color": "",
                    "highlight_text_color": "",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
