                "width": 32,
                "width_mobile": 24
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_da8njd": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We recommend consulting your doctor first. Whey protein and collagen are both food-derived ingredients. The botanicals (moringa, gotu kola, dandelion) are present in very small amounts. The Cappuccino variant contains 58.5mg of caffeine, which may be unsuitable during pregnancy. As with anything during pregnancy or breastfeeding, please consult your doctor first.</p>",
